/**
 * FQA QuIPS Linkage — KoboToolbox → Google Sheets puller
 * -------------------------------------------------------
 * Pulls 8 QuIPS Kobo forms and writes each into its own sheet tab.
 *
 * INCREMENTAL REFRESH
 * - Uses `_uuid` as the unique key.
 * - Appends only submissions not already present.
 *
 * NEWBORN UNIT TRANSFORMATIONS
 * Applied only to the "Newborn Unit" sheet before writing:
 * - starttime      → date_started     (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM)
 * - endtime        → date_ended       (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM)
 * - today          → date_submitted   (YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM)
 * - facility_profile/county            → county (coded → name)
 * - facility_profile/facility          → facility (coded → name;
 *     uses post-2026-01-01 map when date_submitted >= 2026-01-01,
 *     otherwise uses pre-2026 map)
 * - facility_profile/gazetted_facility → facility_level (2/3/4 → Level N)
 * - facility_profile/contact           → contact_person (coded → label)
 * - facility_profile/nam_contact       → name_contact
 *
 * SETUP
 * 1. Paste into Apps Script Code.gs
 * 2. Set Script Property KOBO_API_TOKEN (File → Project settings → Script properties)
 * 3. Run fullRefreshAllForms once (recommended after transform changes)
 * 4. Then use pullAllForms / createDailyTrigger for incremental updates
 *
 * Do not commit the API token to git.
 */

